Original work

TimeLapse was started by dan, who wrote and released versions up to 1.5.
That early version is the foundation of this project. Versions 2.0 and later
were written and are maintained by Srujan (ksrujankanth), who holds copyright
on the changes made from 2.0 onward. The MIT terms above apply to this
repository as it is published here.


Third-party components

This repository includes the OpenCV Android module (Java sources and prebuilt
native libraries) under opencv/. OpenCV is licensed under the Apache License
2.0, see https://opencv.org/license/ and https://github.com/opencv/opencv.
The OpenCV code and binaries keep their own license and are not relicensed
under the MIT terms above.

Kotlin, AndroidX, Material Components, and the other libraries resolved by
Gradle at build time are not part of this repository. They keep their own
licenses, which are mostly Apache 2.0.


